%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: LashaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Papers are right here. You going to look, or just stand there? Lasha
      Gagua. I drive a taxi, western district, though half the routes are blocked
      now.
    animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: Nine years I've been driving these streets. Used to know every shortcut.
      Before your people closed them all.
    animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: What do you mean, our people?
      npcResponse: Security. Government. Whoever put up these barriers. I don't
        care which box you tick.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: Nine years is a long time.
      npcResponse: Long enough to know when a city's dying and when it's just
        sick. This one's still sick. Salvageable.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I've got a wife and two kids in the western block. They stay home,
      I keep working. Someone's got to bring money in. Half my fares are people
      trying to reach the exits now. I charge double.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: You're new here. Previous officer had a system. Checked once, waved
      me through. Papers. Permit runs to September.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I do my job the same for everyone.
      npcResponse: Sure you do. Well, do it fast. I've got a fare waiting and time
        is still money.
      animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    - playerChoiceText: What kind of system?
      npcResponse: The efficient kind. Respect for everyone's time. You'll learn
        it. Or you won't.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
